%% title: Authenticate a deploy call with a GitHub OIDC token
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CI as deploy job
    participant GO as GitHub OIDC
    participant S as estate-kit service
    CI->>GO: request an ID token, audience estate-kit
    GO-->>CI: JWT
    CI->>S: deploy, Bearer JWT
    S->>S: repository_id and owner id admitted?
    S->>S: claim policy: event_name, job_workflow_sha, ref_type, runner, environment
    S-->>CI: rollout id
    CI->>GO: token expired or service restarted: request a fresh ID token
    GO-->>CI: JWT
    CI->>S: watch, resume after the last sequence, Bearer JWT
    S->>S: the same claim policy
    S-->>CI: events since that sequence
